WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.667
The Dashboard opens on Today: what needs doing now.

2
00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:08.803
The tiles count new orders, copies to order and books ready for pickup.

3
00:00:08.803 --> 00:00:14.595
Needs Attention lists problems, each with a button that takes you to the fix.

4
00:00:14.595 --> 00:00:20.709
The Special Announcement bar shows across the top of your website. Click it to change it.

5
00:00:20.709 --> 00:00:25.346
Trends shows orders per day and the most-reserved titles.

6
00:00:25.346 --> 00:00:32.400
System shows whether the nightly jobs and backups ran on time.
